"""twinfetch - fastfetch with a spinning ASCII Aphex Twin logo.

usage: twinfetch [-s SECONDS] [-- fastfetch args...]
  spins until a key is pressed (or Ctrl-C)
  -s SECONDS      spin for this long instead, then settle facing front
"""
